OL,3,GNEWSALidl crash 'sounded like massive
OL,4,Abomb'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who witnessed a car crashing
OL,7,Fthrough the entrance of a Lidl store in
OL,8,FWolverhampton, which left a man dead,
OL,9,Fsaid it sounded "like a massive bomb"
OL,10,Fgoing off.
OL,12,FThe man, in his 30s, was pronounced
OL,13,Fdead at the scene after the crash,
OL,14,Fwhich West Midlands Ambulance Service
OL,15,Fwas called to just before 18:00 BST on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
