OL,3,GNEWSALidl crash 'sounded like massive
OL,4,Abomb'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service said the woman who was
OL,7,Fdriving the car is believed to have had
OL,8,Fa medical incident at the wheel. She
OL,9,Fwas treated at the scene before being
OL,10,Ftaken to hospital for further
OL,11,Ftreatment.
OL,13,F"It was a massive panic, it was a
OL,14,Fhorrible experience, chaotic, scary,
OL,15,Fpainful," said Tina Bonev.
